WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:11.400
TSM Intelligence Platform connects workforce, frontline, enterprise and executive systems in one loop.

2
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:22.400
This view switches between two preset workforce scenarios, each with its own readiness and compliance configuration. That is a demo configuration, not a live candidate lookup.

3
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:30.700
That intelligence has to reach the point where work actually happens: the L one Ticket Copilot, running in the real application.

4
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:37.700
The ticket is classified instantly, and closure stays blocked until the evidence is in.

5
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:43.700
The same intelligence pattern extends into the enterprise, in the SAP Strategist.

6
00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:53.500
Starting the journey traces a business object across commerce, CRM, master data, CPQ, approval and downstream operations.

7
00:00:53.500 --> 00:01:02.800
Instead of viewing each system on its own, TSM shows the relationships between them: the business object trace, stage by stage.

8
00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:09.000
The same data condition can propagate across multiple application boundaries downstream.

9
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:17.100
The enterprise impact view shows that propagation across systems, not just the health of one application on its own.

10
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:24.100
The strategist assembles everything an executive decision needs.

11
00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:36.000
The Operational OS brings recovery data into one executive package once a case is selected. This environment has no case connected yet, so the package view is shown empty, honestly.

12
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:43.000
One governed loop, end to end, in the real application.

